      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEX GUNN (1) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Was a strong winner last time (21.63) over 380m at this track in a Free For All. Form at the trip excellent including 12 wins. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from five starts. Great chance again. LORD EDDIE (2) finished fourth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his excellent 21.68 win at this track over 380m. Has the ability and can find winning form again. COLONEL'S RANGER (7) has a strong record here with six wins and four placings from 14 starts. Below best last time at this track (22.13) in a Free For All, finishing a 7 length sixth. Makes strong appeal on best. GIDGEE BUG (3) has been freshened and can sneak into the frame on his best form.",
